note seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/view.om: fstatfs writes A, so a view is error 20.
om2
fn peek a view uchar * to long
ret fstatfs 0 a 0 120
end
fn main to int
b = new uchar 120 0
r = peek b
ret 0
end
note gate-pools: uses fstatfs on purpose: owner=seed/host/fstatfs/check.sh new-word acceptance or refusal qualification
